{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Celebrating Christmas", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Christmas Card", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 8, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 18, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Writing a Christmas Card", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You write Christmas cards to friends and loved ones to show you are thinking about them during the holiday season.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Wishing your family peace, love, and joy at Christmas and always.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Wishing you a very merry Christmas.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Happy holidays, from our house to yours.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Sending wishes to you and yours for a beautiful holiday season and a peaceful New Year.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You can include:</p> Your thoughts</br> Example:<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">All my love and thoughts are with you during this Christmas season.</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic\">Sending you my thoughts and heartfelt wishes for a wonderful Christmas.</li></ul></span>  Why you are thankful </br>Example: <ul><li><span class=\"italic\">I am so lucky that you are part of my family.</span></li><li><span class=\"italic\">I am so thankful that I have a friend like you in my life.</span></li></ul>   A reflection</br> Example: <ul><li><span class=\"italic\">Thanks for being there for me this year. You are like a Christmas gift all year round.</span></li></ul> New Year or plans for the future</br> Example: <ul><li><span class=\"italic\">I love the holiday season because of the time I get to spend with you. Can't wait to see you soon.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use different tenses to talk about the future: the <span class=\"italic\">Future Simple,</span>, the<span class=\"italic\"> Present Continuous</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">Be going to</span>. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you make a decision at the time of speaking, you use <span class=\"strong\">will</span>. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Example:</span> <span class=\"italic\">I hope we'll see each other soon!</span> <br><br>  For intentions (when something is already planned or definite), you use <span class = \"strong\">be going to</span>. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Example:</span> <span class=\"italic\">I'm going to wear my new sweater skating tonight.</span> <br><br>  For arrangements, you use the<span class=\"strong\"> Present Continuous</span> tense. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Example:</span> <span class=\"italic\">I am planning to include it in my upcoming cookbook, Vanessa Cooks.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "earmuffs", "type": "name"}, {"content": "warm material worn on the ears to protect them from cold weather", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Thank you so much for the retro sweater and ear muffs!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you can use in a letter to friends and family.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "upcoming", "type": "name"}, {"content": "happening or appearing soon", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  We are looking forward to the upcoming event!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "credits ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a list of the names of the people who have worked on a book or movie", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I promise to include your name in the credits.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hipster", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a modern culture that values independent thinking, progressive politics, art and indie-rock, creativity, and  intelligence", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I saw that they were from my favorite hipster store on the harbor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "retro", "type": "name"}, {"content": "looking like or relating to styles or fashions from the past", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Thank you so much for the retro sweater.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Design 3 Christmas cards for family members.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 30-45 words in each Christmas card.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include a greeting, body paragraph and closing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose different phrases.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include <span class=\"italic\">will</span>, <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">present continuous</span> for future", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your Christmas cards aloud to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I design 3 Christmas cards.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write Christmas card to family members.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the cards aloud to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "